    separately and the answer is measured.
    +10% on slot 3 (in-plane)    moves the SH error by 9.499e-01
    +10% on slot 4 (depth)       moves the SH error by 9.190e+00
    +10% on slot 5 (depth)       moves the SH error by 0.000e+00

    SH:  ordinary                   err 4.9763e-03   ratio 1.0000
